#4471 was merged as one known issue, with one fix queued. The table is the split the desk's own cause rule makes. A row marked as not this ticket has no ticket of its own. The note under the table is a reading that is not the cause it was filed under.

<CauseTable ticket={4471} />

The public repo has one ticket for the parser reading, one for the hint reading, and one for the one-day move named in the desk notes. A report is on one ticket. The table still counts the one-day move inside the parser row, which is where those reports were filed.

